ng to only create an immune  response when they are conjugated with  several other sort of several other  carrier molecules so immuno gene is  molecular Li more complex than an  antigen so immunogenicity of any antigen  depends upon its molecular size  complexity and also the chemical  composition and heterogeneity of them  and definitely its foreignness like the  source where it is coming from that  because self antigens don't sort of  produce an immune response against its  own system that is how this terms are  explained if you liked this video give  it a big thumbs up and don't forget to  Like share and subscribe thank you
 

